// BT-5215: a non-Integer class that answers `to:do:` and `to:by:do:` with its
// own methods. An inlined writing loop on it would bypass them, so it raises
// `stateful_block_dispatch`; a read-only block reaches the methods.

Value subclass: Bt5215CustomRangeStart

  to: _end do: _block => #custom

  to: _end by: _step do: _block => #customBy
